      "id": "6deaa52a-43ee-486e-89eb-2708c8f97496",
      "name": "DedupeUrls"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Picks which pages get audited\nconst plan = $('FromOrchestrator').first().json.sample_plan;\nconst pages = $input.all().map(item => item.json);\n\n// Legal pages are out of scope: nobody searches for them, and they are not meant to sell\nconst EXCLUDE = [\n  '/dpa-', '/gtc-', '/toms-and-sub-processors', '/data-privacy-policy',\n  '/recruiting-privacy-notice', '/privacy-data-handling', '/cookie-declaration'\n];\nconst inScope = pages.filter(page => !EXCLUDE.some(part => page.url.includes(part)));\n\nconst selected = [];\nfor (const [type, limit] of Object.entries(plan)) {\n  const newestFirst = inScope.filter(page => page.page_type === type)\n    .sort((a, b) => (b.lastmod || '').localeCompare(a.lastmod || ''));\n  selected.push(...newestFirst.slice(0, limit));\n}\nreturn selected.map(page => ({ json: page }));"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2240,
        0
      ],
      "id": "e1ed5331-7d1e-42dc-beaf-8b8d361a7357",
      "name": "SelectSample"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GP - Collect URLs\nBuilds the list of pages to audit from the website's sitemap.\n\n**In:** sitemap_types (which sitemaps to read), sample_plan (how many pages per type)\n**Out:** one item per page: url, page_type, lastmod, image_count\n\nLegal pages are left out on purpose (see SelectSample).",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 672,
        "color": "#A45051"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -96,
        -576
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "4a7cad54-0def-405c-9894-c9988a59156c",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Read the sitemap index\nThe site has one main sitemap that lists 11 smaller sitemaps (pages, blog, guides, ...).\nThis step reads it and keeps only the types chosen in the settings.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 1152,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -96,
        -240
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "bade306c-296e-4d6f-bcd4-e1511190ed08",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Read each chosen sitemap\nDownloads each chosen sitemap (1 per second, to be polite to the server) and turns it into one item per page.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 624,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1088,
        -240
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "96b538d2-851c-4274-ba77-38a67cdbd293",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Build the page list\n- Keeps only the fields we need and counts images per page.\n- Removes duplicate URLs.\n- **Leaves out legal pages** (DPA, terms, privacy, cookie declaration): nobody searches for them, and they are not meant to sell.\n- Picks pages per type, newest first. For the full audit the plan is set to 999 = all pages.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 704,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1744,
        -240
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "641582db-e841-4e22-9de5-22720bee49da",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    }
